on leftclick on a bamboo door:
    # player is sneaking
    applyDoorEffect(player, clicked block)

function applyDoorEffect(p: player, b: block):
    {_p} is a player
    {_b} is a block
    loop all players in radius 20 around {_b}:
        play sound "minecraft:block.stone.break" in master category with volume 10 with pitch 0.7 at (location of {_b}) to loop-player